      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can you even get the current gestures to consistently trigger on the Index? No hate, the technology is cool, but I've never been so frustrated by a game controller in my life. Sometimes it just randomly won't track a pinkie finger lifting or won't fully extend the index finger. Really, really frustrating. Can't imagine people who play actual games using these are doing it, unless the finger movement is very under-utilized in gameplay.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
