      "value": "@{5a69eccdd20e79665351e7c1|full_name}: By that logic bikes work perfectly and cars break all the time so cars are worse. It's more advanced technology: it fails more often just because it gives you way more possibilities. A button will fail less than a bunch of sensors tracking each finger individually.",
