  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Could we have at least a few more gestures for the Index controllers? I'm not asking for literally every possible finger position, just a few more (I can at least thing of three possible gestures: middle finger, the phone one? (pinky and thumb up) and the ok sign which could replace the rocknroll one).\n\nI know some people won't like this as it would be kinda exclusive to one type of controller, but it won't really affect them negatively. I think allowing more creativity for at least a part of the userbase is something positive.",
